  "reviewer_note": "Shape domed_building. The model describes the dome only (all three measurements are the dome on the Holy See page), so the globe shows nothing for the basilica before 1546. Other pages give 136 m or 136.57 m to the cross and 42.56 m internal diameter; the official page was used. Only UNESCO and the Holy See were usable publishers; the Holy See is also the owner.",
